    {
      "id": "vu_TIQFscQ7ienOs76cok",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5572.8636380479975,
      "y": 3439.3419073813084,
      "width": 1146.3526611328125,
      "height": 1750,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fcc2d7",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7n",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1055298326,
      "version": 2789,
      "versionNonce": 822556496,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782998968366,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "big fat ?\n\nwhat to display in the hero ? bestseller or new products\nhow to know if the product is new?\n->\nhow does the bestsellers work?\n-> calculate the directly from the sales over 10-30 days for top 3 products\n->source data : the orders n product variants n product\n->cache table :  plain table you manually populate \nand refresh on with schedule or trigger + no need for real time accuracy\n\nhow discounts work?\ndata : discount n orders \nconstraint : keep history of the prices of products, so the sales are accurate\nhow to keep track of the discount uses ?\n\n\nhow collections work? limited products (sell fast ?) ?\n->new arrival, for seasons, for use cases, material wise, for occasions(holidays)\n->\n\nhow to store them reviews ?\n->one review per customer, \n->verify if customer did get the product before enable the comment space\n->give a rating from 1 to 5 stars\n\ncases to get freeshipping ?\n->depends on order subtotal, destination zone, \n->guelmin for free n rest with fixed fee\n-> buy 5 products and get free shipping\n-> spend a sum like 5000 dh and get free shipping\n->nah just city to a fee table\n\nwhat about the refunds ?\n->within 7 days of delivery \n->manage the stock after shipping/refunds ?\n\nwhat kind of data is shown in the admin dashboard?\n->revenue made real time(orders and refunds)\n->low stock (products_variants, products, brands)\n->approving/refusing refunds(refunds, orders, users, product_variants)\n->adding a new product(brands, categories, products, product_variants)\n->creating new collection(collections, products, product_collections\n->display the inventory of products(like the search page) with the colletions made \n\n\nhow is the payment method stored in the database ? \n->create a dummy card number and cvv to pass the transaction\n->card number + name on the card + cvv + experation date (inputs for the payment)\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "big fat ?\n\nwhat to display in the hero ? bestseller or new products\nhow to know if the product is new?\n->\nhow does the bestsellers work?\n-> calculate the directly from the sales over 10-30 days for top 3 products\n->source data : the orders n product variants n product\n->cache table :  plain table you manually populate \nand refresh on with schedule or trigger + no need for real time accuracy\n\nhow discounts work?\ndata : discount n orders \nconstraint : keep history of the prices of products, so the sales are accurate\nhow to keep track of the discount uses ?\n\n\nhow collections work? limited products (sell fast ?) ?\n->new arrival, for seasons, for use cases, material wise, for occasions(holidays)\n->\n\nhow to store them reviews ?\n->one review per customer, \n->verify if customer did get the product before enable the comment space\n->give a rating from 1 to 5 stars\n\ncases to get freeshipping ?\n->depends on order subtotal, destination zone, \n->guelmin for free n rest with fixed fee\n-> buy 5 products and get free shipping\n-> spend a sum like 5000 dh and get free shipping\n->nah just city to a fee table\n\nwhat about the refunds ?\n->within 7 days of delivery \n->manage the stock after shipping/refunds ?\n\nwhat kind of data is shown in the admin dashboard?\n->revenue made real time(orders and refunds)\n->low stock (products_variants, products, brands)\n->approving/refusing refunds(refunds, orders, users, product_variants)\n->adding a new product(brands, categories, products, product_variants)\n->creating new collection(collections, products, product_collections\n->display the inventory of products(like the search page) with the colletions made \n\n\nhow is the payment method stored in the database ? \n->create a dummy card number and cvv to pass the transaction\n->card number + name on the card + cvv + experation date (inputs for the payment)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
